 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd                                      MASTER SERVICES\n221 Baker Street, LS1 4DY Leeds, United Kingdom                    AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB789911619\n\nFROM                                                     BILL TO\n\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd                                     Albion Components Ltd\n221 Baker Street                                         14 King Street\nLS1 4DY Leeds                                            LS1 4DY Leeds\nUnited Kingdom                                           United Kingdom\nVAT: GB789911619\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 04/01/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at 221 Baker Street, Leeds\n(\"Party A\"), and Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Leeds (\"Party\nB\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A  Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Amelia Clarke\n Party B  Albion Components Ltd / Harry Whitfield\n Date     04/01/2026",
